{"version": 1, "sourceSha256": "d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace", "documents": [{"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}, {"id": "offline-d9e4400d883ee35a21c5", "filename": "20-Part C.mp3", "sha256": "d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-5/d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace.mp3", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace.json", "format": "mp3", "role": "recording"}], "units": [{"id": "jahshan-1pHIRcchvDQfFMuvefCTDcHNdiBDhfX6H-C-1", "label": "Jahshan set 20 · Part C · Extract 1", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [222], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "What does Dr Dugan suggest defines a patient’s health literacy?\nSelect one:\nA. how frequently they use available health services.\nB. how well they communicate with health professionals.\nC. how clearly they understand health-related information.", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "As a result of her own research, and other studies, Dr Dugan believes\nSelect one:\nA. most patients don't listen carefully enough to health professionals.\nB. patient health outcomes rely heavily on a person's health literacy.\nC. governments aren't doing enough to assist with health literacy.", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "Dr Dugan says most health professionals have at one time\nSelect one:\nA. had complaints made about their poor communication.\nB. incorrectly assumed their instructions were understood.\nC. forgotten how to speak to patients in their own language.", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Why does Dr Dugan share the examples about previous patients?\nSelect one:\nA. to show how she teaches health literacy.\nB. to illustrate findings from recent research studies.\nC. to demonstrate the importance of clear communication.", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "The paediatrician example about the \"teach-back\" method demonstrates\nSelect one:\nA. how easy it is to overlook whether or not a patient has understood instructions.\nB. what patients do and do not understand about health literacy.\nC. the best way to confirm what a patient understands.", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "What does Dr Dugan make about improving patient safety and care?\nSelect one:\nA. It is essential to have reliable health care for all patients.\nB. Focusing on acute care settings is the most important aspect.\nC. Delivery of information beyond the traditional care settings is vital.\n\nC6.2", "sourcePage": 222, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}, {"id": "jahshan-1pHIRcchvDQfFMuvefCTDcHNdiBDhfX6H-C-2", "label": "Jahshan set 20 · Part C · Extract 2", "part": "C", "sourceSha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "pages": [223], "questions": [{"number": 1, "prompt": "Dr Marshall believes that the low-fat era is coming to an end because\nSelect one:\nA. the US Dietary Guidelines have changed towards fat.\nB. 35 years ago the US Dietary Guidelines were very different.\nC. fat and cholesterol are no longer linked in the US Dietary Guidelines.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 2, "prompt": "Dr Marshall suggests that LDL particles\nSelect one:\nA. are more dangerous when they’re smaller.\nB. have nothing to do with saturated fat.\nC. pose no risk to a person’s health.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 3, "prompt": "What are Dr Marshall's views on saturated fats?\nSelect one:\nA. Refined carbohydrates are more dangerous than saturated fat.\nB. Not all saturated fats are the same as others.\nC. Vegetable oil should replace saturated fat.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 4, "prompt": "Why doesn't Dr Marshall believe people should stop worrying about cholesterol?\nSelect one:\nA. Biological solutions haven’t been able to solve the problem.\nB. People continue to eat too many foods high in fat and sugar.\nC. More research is required to understand how fat enters the blood.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "C", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 5, "prompt": "Dr Marshall says there is no agreement over nutritional science because\nSelect one:\nA. there are too many opinions when it comes to a person’s diet.\nB. there are a lot of different ways to interpret the information.\nC. there isn’t enough money to fund high quality research.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "B", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}, {"number": 6, "prompt": "In Dr Marshall's opinion, many organisations and experts need to\nSelect one:\nA. become more open-minded about embracing current studies.\nB. encourage more people to eat a diet high in vegetables.\nC. stop saying that eating saturated fat is bad.", "sourcePage": 223, "choices": ["A", "B", "C"], "kind": "question", "answer": {"text": "A", "page": 225, "source": {"id": "offline-51c74510842bc49d5bab", "filename": "Listening Jahshan OET Collection.pdf", "sha256": "51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa", "assetPath": "https://github.com/genododi/OET/releases/download/genododi-library-2026-10-19-3/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.pdf", "textPath": "imported-resources/text/51c74510842bc49d5babacdaf2a5b241a20e90979e03a98534645f748a7120fa.json", "format": "pdf", "role": "paper"}}}], "skills": ["listening"], "recordings": ["d9e4400d883ee35a21c5064a12d2fc9987be15467f83571a946706b65846eace"], "answerSources": [], "matchEvidence": "Exact original recording SHA-256 in the verified Jahshan collection"}]}
